    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, you are able to teleport short distances through mist. As an action, you can spend 1 chi point and teleport 60 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. As part of the same action you can use your @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.ywq3AcNAYMMJcIdj]{Soothing Mist} on a target within range of your new position.</p>",
